</div>
<div id="stepTitle" style="font-weight:bold;margin-top:4px">Absorption on the wheel</div>
<div id="stepNarration" style="line-height:1.3">Start on the color wheel with absorption near 620 nm, in the orange-red region. The marker opposite it indicates the complementary blue/cyan appearance.</div>
